            <ArticleTitle>Analgesic and antiinflammatory activity of antibodies to histamine under experimental conditions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>83-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Ultralow doses of antibodies to histamine in produced an antiproliferative effect on experimental animals with inflammation. Analgesic activity of antibodies to histamine was revealed on the model of acetic acid-induced writhing.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
